{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YEAH YEAH IT LOOKS EASY, TRY IT THEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092490/extras/fa5447c402092ee9eb8fcaaef0287e22.poster.avif?t=1760290197\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092490/extras/fa5447c402092ee9eb8fcaaef0287e22.webm?t=1760290197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break the Machine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playgrounds are silent, smiles are scheduled, and fun is filed under \u201cforbidden.\u201d In this clock-punching land of absolute order, one ordinary man refuses to lock away his inner kid. Stuffed into a slapdash cardboard mech suit, he bounces skyward to prove that chaos is worth every bruise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092490/extras/b09926718e9ac16a88a0e3c195e84925.poster.avif?t=1760290197\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092490/extras/b09926718e9ac16a88a0e3c195e84925.webm?t=1760290197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jet Jitters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Micro Thruster</strong> \u2013 A jury-rigged jetpack gives a heartbeat of thrust \u2014 just enough to rescue you\u2026 or send you spiraling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Fuel on Fumes</strong> \u2013 The tank empties in seconds; refills are scarce and never convenient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Last-Chance Heroics</strong> \u2013 Fire the thruster at the perfect millisecond to salvage free-fall panic or stretch your flight by a few humbling meters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092490/extras/8178f6f8bc47d19bedad45a7a37da9bc.poster.avif?t=1760290197\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092490/extras/8178f6f8bc47d19bedad45a7a37da9bc.webm?t=1760290197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Obstacles With Issues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge moving walls that track your hops, swinging wrecking hammers, cannons that treat you like target practice \u2014 everything here craves a cardboard casserole. Outsmart them or taste the defeat .</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bounce, Crash, Climb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect spectacular ascents, catastrophic nosedives, and the smug grin of gravity itself. Each wipeout is a lesson; every retry is a victory lap for your sanity (and your bruises). Gravity may pull you down, but it can't stop you from going up! That\u2019s where the glory\u2019s at.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pogo a cardboard man through madness, blast that jetpack on fumes, and punch gravity where it hurts. Suit up \u2014 cereal boxes and all. (Single-player now; co-op climbing madness coming soon!) See you at the summit... if the duct tape holds.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4092490?t=1760290197","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4092490?t=1760290197","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092490/ed8a0da352f2f36bd03d0bb8da05df8623a45ec6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760290197","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092490/ed8a0da352f2f36bd03d0bb8da05df8623a45ec6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760290197","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YEAH YEAH IT LOOKS EASY, TRY IT THEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092490/extras/fa5447c402092ee9eb8fcaaef0287e22.poster.avif?t=1760290197\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092490/extras/fa5447c402092ee9eb8fcaaef0287e22.webm?t=1760290197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break the Machine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playgrounds are silent, smiles are scheduled, and fun is filed under \u201cforbidden.\u201d In this clock-punching land of absolute order, one ordinary man refuses to lock away his inner kid. Stuffed into a slapdash cardboard mech suit, he bounces skyward to prove that chaos is worth every bruise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsi