rash, Climb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect spectacular ascents, catastrophic nosedives, and the smug grin of gravity itself. Each wipeout is a lesson; every retry is a victory lap for your sanity (and your bruises). Gravity may pull you down, but it can't stop you from going up! That\u2019s where the glory\u2019s at.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pogo a cardboard man through madness, blast that jetpack on fumes, and punch gravity where it hurts. Suit up \u2014 cereal boxes and all. (Single-player now; co-op climbing madness coming soon!) See you at the summit... if the duct tape holds.</p>","developers":["Bruder Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3902930","name":"Pogo Panic"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092490/e797670578ff1b4927f65c0783b74677659cb374/header.jpg?t=1760290197","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4092490/53149780/e40540ee6567e9a17d77f57019b6959c66fb6345/1760289785/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760290195","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4092490/53149780/e40540ee6567e9a17d77f57019b6959c66fb6345/1760289785/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760290195","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4092490/53149780/e40540ee6567e9a17d77f57019b6959c66fb6345/1760289785/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760290195","id":257216518,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216518/movie480.mp4?t=1760290195","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216518/movie_max.mp4?t=1760290195"},"name":"Pogo Panic Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216518/01f2f4a39907815f2a846862957c53d2528be9c0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760290195","webm":{"480":"https